  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><article class=\"pb-12 md:pb-20\"><header class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 container mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex flex-col justify-center px-4 pb-8 lg:pb-0 lg:px-0 lg:pr-12 order-last lg:order-first\"><h1 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-6xl\">The Gentleman Racers Collection</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-4\"><span class=\"inline-block text-sm px-3 py-1 border border-black rounded-full\">Collections</span></div><span class=\"text-neutral-500 block mt-6\">We're proud to present a small collection of fully restored classics. The collection consists of race-prepped classics for e.g. historic racing or downhill competitions as well as sports cars for street use. English, German and Italian is on the menu!</span><div class=\"flex mt-6\"><div class=\"mr-2\"><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-full w-[48px]\" src=\"/assets/bidders-highway-63938c17.jpg\"></a></div><div><a href=\"/en/authors/bidders-highway\" class=\"block hover:underline\">Bidders Highway</a><span class=\"block text-neutral-500 text-sm\">December 19, 2023 12:00</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-8 lg:mb-0\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/210a9462020580b25ca8f9a1b2eef4c0\" width=\"1220\" height=\"840\"></div></div></header><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 my-8 lg:my-12\"><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 auction-body\"><div>Looking for something exciting for historic racing? Maybe something insanely fast for thrilling hillclimb races? Do not console! Bidders Highway can now present a small collection of race-prepped cars in absolute top condition!<br><br><br>The collection consists of four unique cars in absolute mint condition. First up is a fully restored 1965 Austin Cooper that has had the same owner since 1978, closely followed by an equally fine Swedish-sold Morgan +8 from 1974. Both British gems are in absolute mint condition and ready to be enjoyed at any vintage rally, club meeting or as any veteran car.<br><br>If you are focused on finding something race-prepped for historic racing, the collection contains an unusual Ginetta G from 1965 with the absolutely legendary 2-liter twincam from Lotus, prepped with half cage, racing seats and four-point harness.<br><br><br>For those of you who like nimble rides uphill, an Osella PA9 refurbished to a fantastic condition is offered. The car comes with a formula 2 engine from BMW that delivers a whopping 305 hp. With an curb weight of 575kg, there is guaranteed to be a thrilling ride for the new owner!</div></div><div class=\"xl:w-2/3 mt-10 lg:mt-12\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">0 Comments</h2><div class=\"mb-16\"><span class=\"block border bg-rose-50 text-neutral-600 p-4 my-4 rounded\">You need to be signed in in order to post comments.</span><ul id=\"comments\"></ul></div></div></div></article><div class=\"bg-black text-white py-10 spotlight-theme\" style=\"\n      background-image: linear-gradient(to top, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        linear-gradient(to right, #000, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)),\n                        url('https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/210a9462020580b25ca8f9a1b2eef4c0');\n    \"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 \"><h3 class=\"text-neutral-400\">The collection</h3><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight max-w-lg mb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/the-gentleman-racers-collection\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">The Gentleman Racers Collection</a></h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-lg mb-7\">We're proud to present a small collection of fully restored classics. The collection consists of race-prepped classics for e.g. historic racing or downhill competitions as well as sports cars for street use. English, German and Italian is on the menu!</p><div class=\"flex items-center font-medium gap-6\"><a href=\"/en/themes/the-gentleman-racers-collection\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300\">View collection</a><a href=\"/en/posts/the-gentleman-racers-collection-1\" class=\"text-jaffa hover:text-zest\">Read the article</a></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><h3 class=\"font-serif uppercase text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-racing-700 text-white pb-4\"><a href=\"/en/themes/the-gentleman-racers-collection\" class=\"hover:text-jaffa transition-colors\">Discover</a></h3><style>\n        #theme_9a4d10d1-3f18-45c1-89b5-95adbdf2d64f { width: max(100%, 220%); }\n        @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {\n          #theme_9a4d10d1-3f18-45c1-89b5-95adbdf2d64f { width: max(100%, 90%); }\n        }\n      </style><div class=\"w-full overflow-x-auto snap-x\"><ul id=\"theme_9a4d10d1-3f18-45c1-89b5-95adbdf2d64f\" class=\"flex gap-2 lg:gap-4\"><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/austin-cooper\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/3907199b58805a5ecea4a5238234e39d\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1965 Austin Cooper \" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1965 Austin Cooper</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/morgan-plus8\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/d434788d85876619d187201c39b2ddde\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1974 Morgan +8 \" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1974 Morgan +8</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/ginetta-g-racer\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/b78f48c692b55d9a0ba8b7aaafcf7fd9\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1965 Ginetta G Racer \" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1965 Ginetta G Racer</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/osella-pa-9\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/73f3349d0a841fe20f04cbe33b43c765\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1983 Osella PA 9 \" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1983 Osella PA 9</h4></div></li><li class=\"w-1/2 lg:w-1/5 snap-start\"><div style=\"aspect-ratio: 82/56;\" class=\"relative\"><a href=\"/en/auctions/porsche-911-e-targa\" class=\"hover:opacity-90 transition-all\"><img src=\"https://bidders-highway.fra1.cdn.digitaloceanspaces.com/73b3cc408238cd9d9a529939a0ef827c\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover rounded-lg hover:brightness-108 transition-all\" alt=\"1970 Porsche 911 E Targa \" width=\"820\" height=\"560\"></a><h4 class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-0 pb-2 h-1/2 text-sm w-full px-2 flex items-end pointer-events-none bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80\">1970 Porsche 911 E Targa</h4></div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"containe